\pard\cf1\f0\fs40\b0\sb0\sa240 About Me Draft\par
\pard\cf1\f0\fs32\b0\sb360\sa120\keepn Personal Introduction\par
\pard\cf1\f0\fs22\b0\sb0\sa160\sl253\slmult1 Hello! My name is Songang Li, and I am an Information Technology student at York University in Toronto, Canada. I am interested in web development, user interface design, artificial intelligence tools, and software development.\par
\pard\cf1\f0\fs22\b0\sb0\sa160\sl253\slmult1 I enjoy turning ideas into practical digital products. In my recent projects, I have worked on responsive websites, interactive user interfaces, desktop applications, and game modifications. I often use modern development tools and AI-assisted workflows to improve productivity, test ideas quickly, and solve technical problems.\par
\pard\cf1\f0\fs22\b0\sb0\sa160\sl253\slmult1 I am a curious and independent learner. When I encounter a new technology or challenge, I usually learn by building small projects, testing different solutions, and gradually improving the final result.\par
